--- !u!114 &1333245901
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 1333245898}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 7d20f73aabcb4cfbaac49363662be3e1, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::DialogueController
  currentDialogueIndex: 0
  textStartOffset: 0
  dialogues:
  - texts:
    - Um...
    - A little forward of you to barge in on my spot, don'cha think?
    - If you're thinking of robbing me, you better be willing to lose a hand!
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - Sorry. That was pretty crass of me. I'm just on edge with all these Watchtowers
      about!
    - I was on my way up to Ouro Station, ya see. I heard there's all kinds of riches
      up there. Old tech, mountains of crystal, you name it!
    - But I didn't expect security to be so damn high! I ducked in this cave to escape
      the artillery, and wha'cha know... one of those damn towers is in here too!
    - Can't I get a break?
    advanceDialogueIndex: 1
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  - texts:
    - I'll probably just wait here for a while...
    - Maybe the towers will get buried in the snow?
    advanceDialogueIndex: 0
    resetDialogueIndex: 0
    canvasDelayOffset: 0
  DialogueName: Makepeace Marlow
  LookAtOverride: {fileID: 0}
  CameraY: 0.55
  canvasDelay: 0
  cameraFollowOffsetLerp: 0
